// SRD 5.1 spyglass (docs/dnd.srd.5.1/04_Equipment): 1,000 gp, 1 lb. In Omnis it reveals the
// tiles along the facing line of sight to sixteen tiles, one Perception check per layer against
// `sense.dc` (PRD §7.2, D18); the automap marks them remotely seen.
